      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-03-02T00:54:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If I post a fan deck here, and then Christopher puts out one of his own decks and they have mechanics in common I could sue GtG, which wastes their time and energy.</p><p>Their lawyers advised them to not allow it, and they also will not look at fan decks we make, like you can't go to a convention and talk to Christopher about your deck idea, he won't listen.</p><p>Just keeps them from creating an openning to get sued.</p>",
